    answer: '<p>Most project management tools cost <strong>$7-15 per user per month</strong> for standard plans. For a team of 10, expect to pay $70-150/month. Enterprise plans with advanced features typically cost $20-30/user/month.</p><p>Many tools offer generous free tiers: Notion (unlimited for individuals), Asana (up to 15 users), ClickUp (unlimited users with limits), and Trello (unlimited boards). We recommend starting with free tiers to evaluate before committing to paid plans.</p>'
