    answer: '<p>All major PM tools (Notion, ClickUp, Asana, Monday.com) use enterprise-grade security including encryption at rest and in transit, SOC 2 compliance, and regular security audits.</p><p>For highly sensitive data, look for tools offering: SSO (Single Sign-On), 2FA enforcement, audit logs, data residency options, and HIPAA compliance if needed. Enterprise plans typically include advanced security features and dedicated support.</p>'
